  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f69c6b1f1e1fc2c4b9a85c7696ada520, type: 3}
  m_Name: AfterHarbor1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSO
  replics:
  - "Did you wipe everything? If they find anything\u2026 well, dying now would be
    pathetic. "
  - "It\u2019d still be your fault. You talk too much. "
  - 'You show off too much for someone with no life plans. '
  - "At least I don\u2019t dream of running away to Spain with a military-pyromaniac
    and a married couple. "
  - "Aww\u2026Don\u2019t be jealous. You were invited too."
  - " I was \u201Ctaken into consideration.\u201D Different thing."
  - "Hm. Either way, I still think I\u2019m right. You won\u2019t last long alone."
  - "At least, For the first time, I\u2019ll try without you. "
  - "Vincent. This is really the end. We\u2019ll never see each other again. You
    know I\u2019ll still wish you luck anyway. "
  - "Thanks\u2026 And don\u2019t worry about the Family. They\u2019ll never learn
    your location. Consider it compensation for your long-awaited personal space."
